  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land Justice Initiative: Amplifying land rights defenders&#xbf; access to justice and uniting stakeholders for land rights accountability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action aims to increase access to justice and protection of land and human rights defenders (LHRDs) through enhanced capacities, programs, and partnerships with stakeholders (e.g., Commission on Human Rights (CHR), Philippine National Police (PNP), local government mechanisms, LHRD networks, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
